{"id":"n62260-1-7","stage":3,"title":"겁 · 胆怯","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62260-1-7-1","ko":"우리 롤러코스터 타러 가자.","zh":"我们一起去坐过山车吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"롤러코스터","meaning":"过山车","explanation":"롤러코스터：过山车。","readings":[{"term":"롤러코스터","audio":"/audio/d65fa88f5f4cd7667321.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:롤러코스터:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"롤러코스터","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"롤러코스터","audio":"/audio/d65fa88f5f4cd7667321.mp3"}},{"text":"타러","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"타러","audio":"/audio/dc1f88b05849fdbc6221.mp3"}},{"text":"가자.","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가자","audio":"/audio/9d6a16e0f490c47dce42.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"d65fa88f5f4cd766","term":"롤러코스터","zh":"过山车","audio":"/audio/d65fa88f5f4cd7667321.mp3","definition":"沿高低弯曲轨道快速运行的游乐设施。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"乘，乘坐","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"坐到交通工具或当作交通工具的动物背上。","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ee608bde752439bbdeba.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62260-1-7-2","ko":"미안하지만 난 겁이 많아서 못 타.","zh":"不好意思，我太胆小了，不敢坐。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"미안하지만","meaning":"抱歉，对不起，不好意思","explanation":"미안하다：抱歉，对不起，不好意思；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"미안하다","audio":"/audio/a3bb8e6d52d6985107bb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67883","senseId":"2","lemma":"미안하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"미안하지만","audio":"/audio/1c500266f4f8a29977a2.mp3"}},{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"난","audio":"/audio/f123177dde5fa8f48570.mp3"}},{"text":"겁이","meaning":"胆怯，害怕","explanation":"겁：胆怯，害怕；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"겁","audio":"/audio/3404e2048e920796c6ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62260","senseId":"1","lemma":"겁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"겁이","audio":"/audio/851899b29586019beabc.mp3"}},{"text":"많아서","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많아서","audio":"/audio/6a9e779aed8b5a8b02ab.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"타.","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readin